          "description": "Level labels as cutypen leaves them (sh_klab): 1 for the launch layer; at a level the ascent reached, 2 if the parcel holds condensate there and 1 if not -- except the stall level, which keeps cuinin's label -- with the base placement's direct labels on top; cuinin's label everywhere else."
